 updated on new AI developments. The team researches new models, tools, and papers, then shares demos through teachers. The program is built to run consistently for two years, so you can keep learning and staying current over time.\", \"hyperparameters\": null, \"input\": \"How does Insider support upskilling and AI updates via free YT/paid courses, weekly sessions, and 2-year consistency?\", \"retrieval_context\": [\"And one more thing, throughout the session\\nif you have any feedback\\nyou can honestly give your feedback\\nbecause we are doing AI Pulse on campusX for the first time\\nand the course will run for two years\\nSo, over time, along with the feedback\\nwe will keep improving it\\nWhatever the feedback is, you should definitely share it\\ntime to time, perfect\", \"But I get, okay, we can do it\\nWhat you can do is\\nWhatever news you want to discuss\\nPut it in the group, we can work on it\\nLike when someone launched Fable 5\\nPeople posted in the group\\nWork on Fable 5\\nAI conferences are good\\nI would say that you\\nAnthropic engineers\\nFollow them\\nNot Anthropic\\nAny\\nBig AI companies\\nYou follow them\\nTheir LinkedIn, Twitter\\nYou will get better knowledge\\nPractice is the key\\nMaybe just last\\n15 minutes section for pool based\\nNoise, if someone would make it\\nYes, we can do it, that's a good idea\\nWe can do it, for sure we can do it\\nNo, there is no course plan for cursor\\nThere is no substitute\\nThere is only one way to do research\\nThere is no substitute\\nMeans\\nYou have to read a lot of things\\nYou have to read multiple aspects\\nThis is the best way to do research\\nSee you in the next session\\nThank you everyone, thank you for your time\\nThank you\", \"I am Ajay, I belong to Uttarakhand\\nAnd I have been working with CampusX for the last two years\\nI am working on the Data Analytics and AI part on CampusX\\nAnd in the last two years, I have delivered multiple courses like\\nOLAMA, Data Analytics, Mentorship Program,